{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_32067","headline":"颂德上贾常侍 · 贾岛","name":"颂德上贾常侍","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"边臣说使朝天子，发语轰然激夏雷。\n高节羽书期独传，分符绦郡滞长材。\n啁啾鸟恐鹰鸇起，流散人归父母来。\n自顾此身无所立，恭谈祖德朵颐开。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"贾岛","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_32067.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_32067","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}